rows.abstract:
Provides for the powers and functions of the Council as regards to the following, among others:
1.  a set of standards and criteria and procedures for the SDG Evaluation System;
2.  an incentive and reward system, based on merit, to encourage the establishment of private sector    and local government programs that aid in the fulfillment of the SDGs;
3.  organization and operation of local exhibitions, seminars and similar activities;
4.  authorization as coordinating body to consolidate and record the whole of nation approach in attaining the SDGS
